{
  "_comment": "Arcade touch keypad: cyd_push.py --keypad --profile arcade, or long-press the display. Same format as _keypad.json. Keys are MAME and RetroArch default keyboard bindings (MAME docs 'Default Keyboard Controls'; RetroArch retroarch.cfg defaults). Frontends can rebind them (Batocera and RetroBat generate emulator configs), so check on your cabinet. Controller hotkey combos and their keyboard equivalents: HOTKEY/SELECT+START = exit -> ESC (RetroArch input_exit_emulator; MAME exit). HOTKEY+X/menu -> F1 (RetroArch menu) or TAB (MAME menu). Save/load state -> F2/F4 (RetroArch), F6/F7 (MAME, then pick a slot), Shift+F6/Shift+F7 (MAME quick save/load). Pause -> P (RetroArch), F5 (current MAME; old MAME builds used P). watch_processes is empty: on arcade cabinets open the keypad by long-press (2 s) instead of a process watch.",
